e  of the planet to the point that nothing  could survive similarly we've seen the  torch burn all the oxygen atoms from an  entire city created by the High  Evolutionary now this could be  problematic as people of course need  oxygen to live so if you can do this on  a planetary scale everybody on earth  would essentially suffocate and so there  are a few different ways the human torch  could probably destroy all life on the  planet itself now I say probably because  we haven't actually seen him do these  things on a large enough of a scale to  really say for sure but part of the fun  of these videos is kind of playing  around with different ideas and  extrapolating and extrapolating things  that could basically never happen but  will be kind of cool to see but anyway  we have seen him set an entire planet  size object on fire so even just going  by that on what we saw with the panels  of various other feeds the human torch  represents a planetary threat so he is  definitely app or a beyond omega-level  threat but with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this video to an end  if you are new here - comments explained  admission you guys at the sub button to  become part of the Rob core if you guys  enjoyed this video make sure you drop a  like and I will catch you all later  Bruce

